    'That host doesn’t resolve, or resolves to a private, loopback or link-local address. Alert webhooks only go to public addresses.' => 'Ese host no se resuelve, o se resuelve a una dirección privada, de loopback o link-local. Los webhooks de avisos solo van a direcciones públicas.',
